  "howToUse": "material.lightMap = texture (colorSpace SRGB, channel 1, flipY true, clamp to edge); material.lightMapIntensity = moods[mood].lightMapIntensity; renderer AgX, toneMappingExposure 1. The map holds ALL diffuse light (direct + bounced): extra ambient, hemisphere or environment diffuse light on the shell adds on top of it. Real-time lights for fixtures: multiply their intensities in these units by moods[mood].exposure.",
